# Never let a locally-dropped certificate, secret, or VCS history end up baked into an image layer
# — COPY . . in the Dockerfile sends the whole build context, and a layer is immutable once built
# even if a later layer deletes the file.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

.git
.gitignore

**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs

**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/secrets.json
.env
.env.*

Logs
data
